            <h2 class="section-title">Legal and Compliance Framework</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>IT Act S.11/12A/80G:</strong> S.11: exempt if 85% applied to charity. 12A: 5-year renewal. 80G: donor deduction. Form 10B audit. Form 10BD by 31 May. ITR-7. S.13: prohibited investments = loss of exemption.</p><p><strong>FCRA 2010 (2020 amendment):</strong> SBI Sansad Marg designated account. Admin ≤20%. FC-4 by 31 Dec. Sub-granting restricted. 5-year validity. MHA Jan 2025: penal action warning.</p><p><strong>Societies Act 1860:</strong> Annual accounts/activity report to Registrar of Societies Delhi. Governing body compliance.</p><p><strong>Companies Act S.8:</strong> Full ROC compliance with RoC Delhi. Statutory audit mandatory. Board meetings, annual return, financial statements.</p><p><strong>CSR Rules (S.135):</strong> CSR-1 on MCA portal. Project-wise utilisation. Annual reporting.</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

